ful difference is thermal throttling (~20-30% drop after 10-20 minutes of sustained heavy load) and port selection.\n3.  **Local Capabilities (16GB RAM):** Detailed out a full stack for a YouTube creator and Upwork freelancer:\n    *   Transcription: MacWhisper, Voice2Sub\n    *   LLM / Code: Ollama (Qwen 3.5 9B), LM Studio, Cursor\n    *   RAG: LlamaIndex + ChromaDB\n    *   Fine-tuning: Prototyping QLoRA on 1B-7B models via MLX is possible, but cloud is needed for production.\n\n\"@ | Out-File -FilePath \"README.md\" -Encoding utf8\n\ngit add README.md\ngit commit -m \"Add session summary README\"\ngit push\n","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\MacBookRepo","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Adding README summary","toolSummary":"Create and push README"}}]}
